<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-INDIA 210, BARBADOS 338-4 - CLOSE.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 210, BARBADOS 338-4 - CLOSE.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN, Barbados 1997-03-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barbardos, replying to India's first innings 210, were 338-4 at the close of the second day of their three-day match on Sunday.</p>
</text>
